# mtplx-65k-admission-shed-monitor
owner: mtplx-cap-prober · cadence: every 2h · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that watches 65K memory_guard admission-shed events under your exact large-prompt shapes?**

## Prompt
Run a 5K-prompt 65K generation, capture memory_guard admission-shed bytes and tok/s.

## Evidence
> A 5010-token 65K prompt triggered prefill_admission_shed with active_bytes 20.3GB and projected_bytes 25.0GB before cache clearing.
